	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Hac ipsa hora accipio munus tuum, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>vir observande, longe preciosius quovis auro purissimo <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>et gemmis in orbe praestantissimis, adamatum illum <persName ref="p18346">Theo<lb xml:id="p1z4"/>doritum</persName>, <placeName ref="l3519">Cyren[en]sem</placeName> episcopum, cuius libros De curandis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>Graecorum affectionibus tanta voluptate legi olim, quanta <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>nullum alium authorem in vita mea.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Ut enim elegantiss<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ime et purissime, ita etiam iucundissime et er<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>uditissime scribit.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Gratias ergo im[m]ortales ago tuae humanitati <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>ac efficiam, ut paucis post diebus exactis multi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>boni fratres et Latine loquentem audire possint.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Deinde maximas gratias ago pro diligenti scriptione tua; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nam ternas aut quaternas a te accepi, ad <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quas non est quod respondeam, nisi quod crudelissimus optimi <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>typographi casus mihi magnum animi dolorem peperit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z15"/>Gaudeo tamen, quod Christus martyres suos sic con<lb xml:id="p1z16"/>firmat, ut veteris ecclesiae exempla in hac nostra <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>inveniamus.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Domini consules multa te salute impertiunt.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Ego quoque tibi et adamatae coniugi<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8"><persName ref="p7850">Martha von Watt</persName>, geborene Grebel.</note> charissimaeque <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>familiae imprecor annum longe felicissimus, ut diu <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>nobis felix est superstes vivas.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z21"/>Minen herren ist zuͦkummen, wie in <placeName ref="l875">Hispanien</placeName> ein <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>grosse summ den kylchenguͤtern ze legen uffge<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>stossen zuͦ schirmm der h. <placeName ref="l425">römischen</placeName> kyrchen.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="de">I<lb xml:id="p1z24"/>n <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> sind bestimpt 10000 ze fuß und 700 ze roß <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>zuͦ gemelter kyrchen schirm.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4">
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="de">Das consilium sye <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>jetzund imm december uff ein nüws ußgeruͤfft; <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>daruff werde man laden die Luterischen, und <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>wer nitt kumme, den werde man bannen, etc.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Uß <placeName ref="l213">Hessen</placeName>, von <placeName ref="l311">Marpurg</placeName> und <placeName ref="l2927">Wetter</placeName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p8115">Pincier</persName> an <persName ref="p8127">Konrad Pellikan</persName>, Ms S 58, 174.</note> hab ich <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>brieff, deren datum 10. decembris, das die sach gar ge<lb xml:id="p1z31"/>stillet by inen und jederman warte uff den tag <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>ze <placeName ref="l157">Franckfurt</placeName>, darvon man noch nüt habe.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="de">Item <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>in hertzog <persName ref="p20318">Heinrychs</persName><note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Herzog <persName ref="p20318">Heinrich d.J. von Braunschweig-Wolfenbüttel</persName>.</note> gezellt syend zweyerley <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>zeychen funden: das ein ist gewest das brunschwi<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>gisch wappen, - wo das an stett und dörffer ge<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>schlagen, hat gnad biß an das plündern bedüt -; <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>das ander ist ein facklen gewesen mitt bäsemen, - <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>wo das gestanden, hatt bedüt, das man da brenn<lb xml:id="p1z39"/>en, das man es mitt bäßmen <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>virpen<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11">mit Besen kehren, im Thurgauerdeutsch heute noch "förben".</note> mög -, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>und diß brieff syend truckt, etc.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="de">Der <lb xml:id="p1z43"/><persName ref="p18720">jung hertzog</persName> schlacht vil die pal zuͦ <placeName ref="l244">Cassel</placeName>, etc.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Plura <lb xml:id="p1z44"/>ubi accepero, communicabo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div6" corresp="regest6">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z45"/><persName ref="p1283">Gessnerus</persName><note xml:id="fn12" type="footnote" n="12"><persName ref="p1283">Konrad Gessner</persName>.</note>, [n]on <lb xml:id="p1z46"/><persName ref="p5483">Knoblouchus</persName><note xml:id="fn13" type="footnote" n="13"><persName ref="p5483">Alexius Knoblauch</persName>.</note>, tuas reddidit; non vidi hu[nc].</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">[V]a<lb xml:id="p1z47"/>le, vir colendissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">5. ian<lb xml:id="p1z48"/>uarii hora 5. pom[eri]diana anno 1546.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">T<lb xml:id="p1z49"/>uus, qui <lb xml:id="p1z50"/>semper.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div7" corresp="regest7">
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">Literas <persName ref="p8126">Oporino</persName> inscriptas bona fide curabo<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse...:]</note>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Clarissimo viro d. doctori <persName ref="p8049">Ioachimo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Vadiano</persName>, <placeName ref="l473">Sangallensi</placeName> consuli <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>prudentissimo<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>In der Vorlage</hi> prudendissimo.</note>, domino suo semper <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>colendo.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>Sangallen.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
